  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "perf(logging): migrate LogManager pipeline to zero-allocation pooled buffers\n\n      - Replace heap-allocating ByteString channel messages with Lucifer.Rent<Buffer>().\n      - Hand over buffer ownership to background consumer via Channel<(Buffer, LogLevel=\"\", object=\"\"?)>.\n      - Ensure strict zero-allocation lifecycle by disposing buffers in consumer Tick() loop and on channel write drops.\n      - Align log format with ASP.NET Core conventions using 6-byte padded level badges and selective ANSI color highlights.\n      - Support optional object instance context while avoiding runtime reflection in hot paths.\n      - Amortize formatting and disk/console I/O overhead through lowest-priority batch draining.",
